+
+To fix this, i added rules (pre-check) in `CvCityAI::AI_chooseUnit`, with the help of chatgpt 5 as usual and always if i may say but anyways etc thanks hehe chatgpt 5 and and all or not but anyways etc, so that, if it is the early game (as of now first 150 turns adjusted to game speed but anyways etc which are most critical for early unit distribution optimization plus most important instead of expanding cities (doesn't happen as much if at all later on so less relevant and could cause issues to)) and we are not in danger:
+
+- if we have expectedly/guessedly but anyways etc too much defenders relative to our city number at this stage of the game (i.e. we don't have enough cities, so don't need as much defenders, invest in offense or versatile UNITAIs rather anyways etc)
+- or if we simply have a majority of defender UnitAIs
+
+Then switch the unitAI of the unit built to an offense or versatile one based on luck and relative proportions if the unit can have said unitAI (else keep defense unitAI or similar defensive UnitAI if i am not mistaken anyways etc) (added note about this in the XML for example of the longbowman at UnitAIs so we keep the UNITAI_COUNTER there or add it if not present before, if it is relevant to our mod and all i mean but anyways etc).
+
