+
+Justinian AI also had it play out differently after our changes (but seemingly reproducible, just as was for joao ai after the changes if i'm not mistaken but anyways etc), now he only has 4 cities, but still too many longbowmen (about 19 at turn 130) for some reason after changes, yet, despite having much less cities (had 5 more or less at quick glance in this case i mean but anyways etc before our changes but anyways etc), he however has a mobile troop of counter longbowmen as can be seen in screenshot, to hopefully make some military gains or at least replace them fast enough and not go bankrupt (with so few cities no need to accumulate excess defenders i mean, aim to expand or die rather i would say as we'd lose late game anyway anyways etc), so i think the results are very good!!!
